WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:05.033
Located right behind us is our
Highmark Center for Health, Wellness and Athletics

2
00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.974
that opened in the Fall of 2024

3
00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:12.379
that supports both physical
and mental wellness for all CMU students.

4
00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:15.982
In there, it houses our University Health
Services,

5
00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:19.052
Counseling and Psychological Services,
wellness studios,

6
00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:22.322
and our main athletic facilities for our sports teams.

7
00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.691
To talk more about what's located inside,

8
00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:29.162
first, we have our Wellbeing Lab,
which has a holistic makerspace

9
00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.732
offering stress management,
mindfulness and spiritual workshops

10
00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.468
to support personal and community wellness.

11
00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:39.406
We also have an interfaith room
which has a circular space

12
00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:43.443
for spiritual practices,
as well as our Posner Wellness Garden,

13
00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:48.214
which is a serene outdoor retreat
designed for relaxation and rejuvenation.

14
00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:53.253
While we're here, I will also like to talk
about sports and athletics here at CMU.

15
00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:57.690
CMU has 19 varsity sports within NCAA

16
00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.160
Division III in the UAA conference.

17
00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.663
But other than that,
we also have club sports and intramurals,

18
00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:07.834
to anyone who is interested to participate
in athletics here on campus.

19
00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:11.304
We have two fitness centers
that is open to all students,

20
00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:15.175
in addition to our athletic facility
in the Highmark Center,

21
00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.944
the health practices spaces for athletic teams,

22
00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:20.180
and the enhanced athletic playing facilities.

23
00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.649
And with that,
we'll pass over to our next stop.

